{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o108b","title":"曹叡援司马懿拒诸葛亮自东征孙权孙韶退","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o108b-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"曹叡援司马懿拒诸葛亮自东征孙权孙韶退","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"出军援军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0364","role":"拒守","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108b-q"]},{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"出军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108b-q"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"退军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108b-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0037","role":"退军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":234,"label":"夏五月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y234","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o107","basis":"夏五月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108b-q","wuzhu-q-o107","zhuge-q-o039","zhuge-q-b-934abed655148ea08df3"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o108b-q","source_order":[47,559,"O108b"],"order":8320}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0037","name":"孙韶","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0364","name":"司马懿","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o108b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-8d6d7b03ef7e78c66434","layer":"original","quote":"是时蜀相诸葛亮出武功〖7〗，权谓魏明帝不能远出；而帝遣兵助司马宣王拒亮〖8〗，自率水军东征。未至寿春，权退还，孙韶亦罢。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":47,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":55,"end":115},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o107","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-adeefad7184b459985c1","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，诏曰：“兵久不辍，民困于役，岁或不登〖2〗。其宽诸逋〖3〗，勿复督课〖4〗。”","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":46,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-934abed655148ea08df3","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-934abed655148ea08df3","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗十二年：建兴十二年（公元 234）。以上诸葛亮出兵北伐共计五次，经由祁山只有两次。后世所说的“六出祁山”并非历史真实。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":269,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1e22705f935572994567","start":0,"end":62},{"id":"zhuge-q-o039","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-e60db7c722cd4fe4fb69","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春〖2〗，亮悉大众由斜谷出，以流马运；据武功五丈原〖3〗，与司马宣王对于渭南〖4〗。亮每患粮不继，使己志不申；是以分兵屯田，为久驻之基。耕者杂于渭滨居民之间，而百姓安堵〖5〗，军无私焉〖6〗。﹝三﹞相持百余日。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":108}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
